      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>\\</p>\n<h1 id=\"atak---load-atak-plugins\"><a href=\"#atak---load-atak-plugins\">ATAK - Load ATAK Plugins</a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"load-atak-plugins\"><a href=\"#load-atak-plugins\">Load ATAK Plugins</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Plugins",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>ATAK can supplied with various Plugins.</li>\n<li>Deploy App's TAK automatically serves you set of plugins that you need to Load upon starting up.</li>\n<li>Installing &#x26; loading need to be only done once.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "1. Data Sync - Missing",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The Data Sync plugin is the most important one. Data Sync Missing from toolbar - time to load it.</li>\n<li>First, select the hamburger menu.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/49e065be1c38ff46.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "2. Data Sync - Tools Menu",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select Plugins.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/959670dee9b0050b.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "3. Data Sync - TAK Package Mgmt",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Tap Data Sync 'Not Installed' to open the installation dialog.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/73ffe372020899e4.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "4. Data Sync - Install Product Plugin",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select OK on Installing Product Data Sync:</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/86500dea7e683f75.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "5. Data Sync - Permission to install",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Do you want to install this app?</li>\n<li>Select Install</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3aa2c36d7d52db85.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "6. Data Sync - Permission missing 1",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>If you get notification that installing from unkown apps from ATAK isn't allowed:</li>\n<li>Select Settings</li>\n<li>Othervise, skip permission missing parts</li>\n</ul>",
