        {
          "title": "Load Other Plugins",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Similarily, load other standard plugins:</li>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li>OpenTAKICU: Video streaming georeferenced in TAK.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li>TAK VNS: Use this instead of Google Maps for routing to destination.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
